## Magic Link Auth

- Magic links generated by Telegram bot
- Token validation in `/api/auth/magic`
- Cookie set on successful validation, then redirect
- Do NOT regress cookie-on-redirect flow

## Secrets Management

- Never commit secrets to code
- Required environment variables:
  - `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`
  - `DATABASE_URL`
  - `ADMIN_TELEGRAM_IDS` (comma-separated)
- Use Vercel environment variables or `.env.local` (gitignored)
